<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74098" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀν-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ass's dung,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.803
			</span></i> : also in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				552a17
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιόνου ὀνίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.192
				</span></i>
			 (elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιονίς</span>): but
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνίδια</span></b>  (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνιαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			) is strangely expld. <i>horse's dung</i> by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
